      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">45 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Behavioral pattern</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Tier 3: recognise and explain</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Visitor</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Add a new operation (tax, shipping, size, pretty-print, type-check) to a whole family of classes without opening any of them. Learn the trick that makes it work, double dispatch, and the one situation where Visitor turns from a gift into a tax on every change.</p>\n  <p class=\"small prereq\"><b>Before this page:</b> <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-oop-interfaces\">Interfaces</a> (program to an interface), <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-oop-polymorphism\">Polymorphism</a> (one call, many bodies), and <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-uml-class\">UML class diagrams</a> for the notation in the Structure picture (arrows and diamonds: <a href=\"{{BASE}}lld/lld-uml-relationships\">relationships</a>).</p>\n"
  },
